<title>UK: LME aluminium ends AM kerb just off new high.</title>
<headline>LME aluminium ends AM kerb just off new high.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Finishes AM kerb near fresh peak in thin volume. Spreads slightly wider with cash/threes at $6/$9 backwardation.</p>
<p>ZINC - Three months slightly firmer, spreads steady in wary market.</p>
<p>COPPER - Slightly weaker, just under $2,300.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Softer, Falconbridge strike fails to excite market.</p>
<p>TIN - Probes under $5,600. LEAD - Barely changed.</p>
</text>
